\subsection{32B Model-Specific Analysis}\label{sec:32b-analysis}

R1-32B and QwQ-32B share the Qwen-32B architecture (64 layers, 5120 hidden) but present opposite detection profiles (\cref{tab:32b_divergence}), making training method the likely differentiator.

